# The binary packages of tools/npm, one per line, read by scripts/npm.sh
# and scripts/npm-check.sh:
#
#   NAME PROGRAM LAUNCHER
#
# NAME is the wrapper package tools/npm/NAME (@cvr/NAME), its bin NAME,
# and its platform packages tools/npm/NAME-OS-CPU (@cvr/NAME-OS-CPU).
# PROGRAM is the example program whose cmd/NAME is built into each
# platform package's bin/NAME. LAUNCHER is `shared` when the wrapper takes
# bin/NAME and install.js from tools/npm/launcher at build time, or `own`
# when it keeps its own in the repository.
work examples/work own
tn1-lint examples/tn1-lint shared
